22">For</span> <span begin="03:16.322" end="03:16.715">the</span> <span begin="03:16.715" end="03:17.574">pro</span><span begin="03:17.574" end="03:18.392">mise</span> <span begin="03:18.392" end="03:19.266">to</span> <span begin="03:19.266" end="03:19.937">come</span> <span begin="03:19.937" end="03:21.032">back</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">还能回到 原先的承诺</span></p><p begin="03:22.743" end="03:25.629" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="03:22.743" end="03:23.190">'Cause</span> <span begin="03:23.190" end="03:23.603">get</span><span begin="03:23.603" end="03:24.011">ting</span> <span begin="03:24.011" end="03:24.423">made</span> <span begin="03:24.423" end="03:24.666">you</span> <span begin="03:24.666" end="03:25.033">want</span> <span begin="03:25.033" end="03:25.629">more</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为得到 让欲望滋长</span></p><p begin="03:26.068" end="03:28.883" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="03:26.068" end="03:26.454">And</span> <span begin="03:26.454" end="03:26.891">ho</span><span begin="03:26.891" end="03:27.299">ping</span> <span begin="03:27.299" end="03:27.716">made</span> <span begin="03:27.716" end="03:27.951">you</span> <span begin="03:27.951" end="03:28.330">hurt</span> <span begin="03:28.330" end="03:28.883">more</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而期望越高 最终只会越失望</span></p><p begin="03:29.167" end="03:32.075" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="03:29.167" end="03:29.608">Oh</span> <span begin="03:29.608" end="03:30.008">there</span> <span begin="03:30.008" end="03:31.282">must</span> <span begin="03:31.282" end="03:32.075">be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我一定是</span></p><p begin="03:32.474" end="03:35.532" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="03:32.474" end="03:32.917">Some</span><span begin="03:32.917" end="03:33.350">thing</span> <span begin="03:33.350" end="03:34.612">wrong</span> <span begin="03:34.612" end="03:34.827">with</spa